            <ArticleTitle>Pain management in patients with rheumatoid arthritis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>38-45</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/01.NPR.0000463784.36883.23</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Rheumatoid arthritis (RA) is one of the most common inflammatory conditions in the United States affecting approximately 1 million adults. This article briefly reviews the evidence-based diagnosis of RA, mainstays of treatment to prevent joint destruction, and pain management.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
